186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "e222f050-384b-58ff-b6eb-7a2a1aaa7d96" :question/math-academy-id "q-320656" :question/problem "Calculate $4F-\\frac{1}{2}G$, where\n$F=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$G=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 4 & -6\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\n| $4F-\\frac{1}{2}G=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each entry of $F$ by $4$ and each entry of $G$ by $\\frac{1}{2},$ and then subtract the resulting matrices, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4F-\\frac{1}{2}G & =4\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 4 & -6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot 4 & 4\\cdot (-1) & 4\\cdot 0 & 4\\cdot 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 0 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-6)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 & -4 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}16-1 & -4-0 & 0-2 & 8-(-3)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}15 & -4 & -2 & 11\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299873 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6727fdd-a614-5ead-9273-08c0a7fec997" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Linear Combination of Two Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b6726c6-30cc-536b-98e1-19ef508a8099" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297786}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b6726c6-30cc-536b-98e1-19ef508a8099" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297786} :answer-field/id #uuid "307d7e56-3727-563f-be6d-69570f5fdc98" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298802} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3